> Equal keys, a displaced minimum and complete budgets

For [2,1,2], the two keys equal to two keep their original identities zero then
two. A single displaced minimum can also create many inversions despite just one
out-of-place input position: [1,2,3,4,0] shifts four predecessors. Calling data
nearly sorted is meaningful only with a stated disorder measure, such as I.

New run/trace calls admit the complete element count before copying. A full
trace has n−1 snapshots for n≥1, each reserving 1+2n logical entries for its
record, values and identities. The complete product is checked for overflow and
against the optional history cap before any copy or sorting. Both optional caps
default to one million and zero disables either; untraced calls ignore the
history cap. Excluded are original/working/final arrays, scalar metadata, vector
capacity and byte/peak RAM. Errors return no partial history. Legacy value-only
calls keep optional caps disabled. Empty and singleton inputs need no insertion
records.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/insertion_controls.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");

    const auto ties = dm::algorithms::insertion_sort_trace({2, 1, 2});
    const auto displaced =
        dm::algorithms::insertion_sort_trace({1, 2, 3, 4, 0});
    std::print("| control | observed |\n| --- | --- |\n| tied sorted values | {} |\n| tied original " "identities | {} |\n| displaced-minimum comparisons | {} |\n| displaced-minimum shifts | {} " "|\n",
               ties.run.values, ties.run.identities,
               displaced.run.work.comparisons, displaced.run.work.shifts);
    (void) dm::algorithms::insertion_sort_trace({3, 1, 2}, {3, 14});
    try {
        (void) dm::algorithms::insertion_sort_trace({3, 1, 2}, {3, 13});
        throw std::runtime_error("history cap accepted");
    } catch (const std::length_error &) {
        std::print("Complete 14-entry trace admitted; cap 13 rejected.\n");
    }
    dm::algorithms::insertion_sort_step_diagram(ties, 1).save_svg(
        "build/insertion_controls.svg");
}
```
